3744: vertical-edge unimodular cusp fan.  These are compact complex
3745: threefolds diffeomorphic to \(S^6\).  Their positive scalar-parameter
3746: loops have the indicated Jin integer and oriented \(\Theta_7\) class.
3747: 
3748: 
3749: \begin{center}\small\begin{tabular}{c p{0.48\textwidth} c c c}\hline
3750: OS row & Source profile & d & Jin integer A & Class mod28 \\
3751: \hline
3752: 45 & \(I_8+4I_1\), \(I_8+II+2I_1\) & 8 & \(-3\) & 25 \\
3753: 47 & \(I_7+I_2+3I_1\), \(I_7+I_2+II+I_1\), \(I_7+III+2I_1\) & 14 & \(-6\) & 22 \\
